      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "sys_killer_moves",
        "reg_northern_plains",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "reg_central_continent"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fairy Li Shan can delay the damage of breaking an alliance agreement.",
      "chapters": [
        815
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fairy-li-shan-and-alliance-damage",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fairy_li_shan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan judges that ability to be this killer move and ties the fame of delay to the Northern Plains lone cultivator Zhou Ye Zi, though Fairy Li Shan never confirms the source.",
      "chapters": [
        815
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fairy-li-shan-and-alliance-damage",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_zhou_ye_zi"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When he and Tai Bai Yun Sheng must honor a duel agreement with feathermen, Fang Yuan notes he is not like Fairy Li Shan and does not have a time path killer move like delay with him, so he cannot break the agreement without fatal backlash.",
      "chapters": [
        868
